{
  "text": "New day, new board. Today's run is the Gauntlet. The job is simple: get from Rank 1 to Rank 8. Take their pieces, fill the meter, pick a power. That is the loop. One board a day. After midnight, it's a new one. Two bishops, diagonals everywhere. It is going to be a lot of diagonals, multiple knights which, yes, fine L-shaped problems. You have until midnight, then it's gone. Then it's a different board.",
